The below is attributable to Spokesperson Tommy Pigott:

Secretary of State Marco Rubio spoke today with Polish Foreign Minister Radosław Sikorski to discuss a deal brokered by the Trump Administration for the release of three Polish prisoners by Belarus. Foreign Minister Sikorski thanked the United States for this historic diplomatic achievement. Secretary Rubio conveyed his appreciation for Poland’s strong partnership and close coordination with the United States to bring them home to safety.